### Test Admin Grouped Returns API

### 1. Get all grouped returns
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/returns/admin/grouped-returns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Get grouped returns with filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/returns/admin/grouped-returns?Year=2025&SaccoType=DepositTaking&Frequency=Monthly
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Get incomplete returns only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/returns/admin/grouped-returns?IsComplete=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Get specific rating definition returns
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/returns/admin/grouped-returns?RatingDefinitionId=your-rating-def-id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Get grouped return details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/returns/admin/grouped-returns/{{groupId}}/{{periodId}}/{{saccoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Get available years
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/returns/admin/filter-options/years
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Get available SACCO types
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/returns/admin/filter-options/sacco-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Get available frequencies
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/returns/admin/filter-options/frequencies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Variables (replace with actual values)
@baseUrl = https://your-api-base-url
@token = your-jwt-token
@groupId = your-rating-definition-id
@periodId = your-period-id
@saccoId = your-sacco-id